<title>USA: US Mint buys 2,981,000 kg shg zinc at avg $1.3787.</title>
<headline>US Mint buys 2,981,000 kg shg zinc at avg $1.3787.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The U.S. Mint said Thursday it bought a total of 2,981,000 kg special high grade zinc from two firms at an average price of $1.3787 per kg.</p>
<p>The Mint bought 1,496,000 kg zinc from Ore &amp; Chemical Co at $1.3842 per kg and 1,485,000 kg of zinc from Hochschild Partners for $1.3733 per kg.</p>
